// Code Injection by ld.so Preload | T1574.006 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/linux/builtin/lnx_ldso_preload_injection.yml
*\/etc\/ld.so.preload*

// Stellar Cyber Query Builder (DSL):
{
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must": [
        {
          "query_string": {
            "query": "*\\/etc\\/ld.so.preload*",
            "analyze_wildcard": true
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
